  "description": "FRAMESET\n\nSizes 1 size 26\"\n\nMaterial Alloy, 6061 TIG welded, hydroformed tubing\n\nDropouts 1x rear fender eyelets, rear rack mounts\n\nFork Suspension fork 80mm travel, alloy crown, steel stanchions, steel lowers, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm)\n\nWHEELSET\n\nRims Alloy double-wall, 26\" x 4.0 x 36H x 13G\n\nSpokes 13G w/brass nipples, black ED finish\n\nTires 26 x 4.0, S/V, Wanda\n\nE-POWER SYSTEM\n\n48V/750W Motor Brushless rear hub motor, 9-pin connector, MXUS\n\n48V/750W Battery Li-ion + Charger w/US plug, w/power level display.\n\nDrive Mode, Display PAS/twist throttle Right side FT158X twist throttle, speed sensor, LCD display panel w/6 PAS levels (Pedal Assist System), w/Start-Aid 6kph (~4mph) Bigstone C600E-USB-LCD Display Head (NO touch-sensitive screen, BT, OTA).\n\n48V/750W range Up to 46 miles\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur Shimano Altus 9S\n\nShifter Altus Rapidfire Plus, w/OGD & Clamp Band\n\nCrankset Prowheel 170mm x 42T w/inside chainguide, outside chainring cover\n\nChain KMC 3/32\" x 118L\n\nBB Steel sealed cartridge, 120mm x 175mm\n\nFreewheel/Cog Shimano 9-speed\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nHeadset Threadless, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm) semi-integrated, steel+alum\n\nBrakes JAX Mechanical disc Front & Rear, 160mm\n\nHandlebars Alloy 680mmW x 25mm Rise\n\nGrips Comfort\n\nStem Alum alloy threadless, 90mm ext x 7° rise\n\nSaddle SuperSoft MTB\n\nSeatpost Alloy, 30.4 x 300mmL, black\n\nSeatpost Clamp Alloy QR\n\nPedals Alloy platform, loose-ball 9/16\"\n\nEXTRAS\n\nKickstand Rear mount, adjustable, aluminum alloy\n\nLight(s) Front (2x AA) + Rear (2x AA), batteries included\n\nChaincover Chainring cover (not chaincover)\n\nRecommended Weight Limit 220lbs\n\nItem Weight 68 lbs (battery included)",
